    ["<Assistant_Title1>【好友-好友度】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>菜单-好友-好友私聊-右上角爱心标志</>\n<Assistant_Title2>获取来源：</>与好友组队击败1个团队/小队副本BOSS、组队击败世界BOSS、组队完成1次竞技玩法、与好友私聊、完成1次双人社交动作、双人共乘均可增加好友度。也可通过赠送社交礼物和赠送外观增加好友度。\n<Assistant_Title2>好友度清除：</><Assistant_Red>删除或拉黑好友会清空双方的好友度，无法恢复</>，请谨慎操作。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[好友]|1406}，{SendAnswer:[好友-好友列表]|1407}，{SendAnswer:[好友-私聊]|1408}，{SendAnswer:[好友-群聊]|1409}，{SendAnswer:[好友-跨服好友]|1411}，{SendAnswer:[好友-删除拉黑]|1412}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Friends - Friendliness】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends - Private Chat - Heart icon in the top right corner</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition Source: </>Teaming up with friends to defeat 1 team/squad dungeon BOSS, teaming up to defeat a world BOSS, teaming up to complete 1 competitive activity, chatting privately with friends, completing 1 duo social action, or riding together can all increase Friendliness. You can also increase Friendliness by gifting social items and appearances.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friendliness Reset: </><Assistant_Red>Deleting or blocking a friend will clear the Friendliness between both parties and cannot be recovered</>, so please proceed with caution.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Cross-Server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete/Block]|1412}",
