    ["　　“审判官”带我见了个人。穿着黑袍，说话像机器，自称是“蒸汽与机械之神教会”的使徒。他说非凡力量是通往更高存在的阶梯，只要我愿意，他可以帮我踏入非凡。为了向我展示这一点，他们当着我的面让一个瘦子变成了狼人！真是一群疯子。\n　　我问他，需要付出什么。\n　　他说，忠诚。\n　　我心里骂了他十遍。我只忠诚于廷根。但我没说出口。我需要他的力量，等我变强了，谁忠诚谁还不一定。\n　　但狼人也太他妈丑了，“通识者”也许不错。"] = " The \"Inquisitor\" brought me to meet someone. He was wearing a black robe, spoke like a machine, and claimed to be an Apostle of the God of Steam and Machinery. He said that Beyonder power is a ladder to a higher existence, and as long as I am willing, he can help me step into the extraordinary. To show me this, they turned a skinny man into a werewolf right in front of me! They are truly a bunch of madmen. \n I asked him what I needed to pay. \n He said, loyalty. \n I cursed him ten times in my heart. I am only loyal to Tingen. But I didn't say it out loud. I need his power; once I become stronger, it's not certain who will be loyal to whom. \n But the werewolf is also too damn ugly; \"Savants\" might be good.",
